      "content": "You can prepare your circle by embedding their own lineage narratives with your house as a foundational truth, so that your identity becomes a comforting revelation rather than a jarring exposure. Conduct blindfolded sensitivity drills where your agents must demonstrate immediate, unified action as sovereigns without needing your direct cues, erasing the hesitation between observation and execution. Finally, ensure every loyalist carries a sealed personal testament signed with dual verification, which automatically unlocks their full authority and resources the moment you reveal yourself, guaranteeing their seamless transformation into your vanguard.",
